# BuildKit honours `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to a context-root
# `.dockerignore`, which matters here: the context root is the parent of the
# moirai and arachne checkouts and is not a directory either repository owns.
#
# Excluding the target directories is not an optimisation — they hold several
# gigabytes of build artefacts that would otherwise be uploaded to the daemon
# on every build.
#
# `README.md` is deliberately *not* excluded: the workspace manifest declares
# `readme = "README.md"` and Cargo refuses to build without it.
**/target
**/.git
**/.github
